{"title":"Career Roadmap · Talent Agency Legal Executive","role":"Talent Agency Legal Executive","summary":"A Talent Agency Legal Executive supports the legal and commercial work involved in representing actors, musicians, influencers, models, creators, presenters, athletes and other talent.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law – LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Media & Entertainment Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Talent Agency Legal Executive supports the legal and commercial work involved in representing actors, musicians, influencers, models, creators, presenters, athletes and other talent."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Entertainment Law","Contracts","Talent Management","Intellectual Property","Media Business"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reviewing talent agreements"},{"text":"Drafting and negotiating contracts"},{"text":"Reviewing endorsement agreements"},{"text":"Managing appearance agreements"},{"text":"Reviewing production contracts"},{"text":"Protecting intellectual-property rights"},{"text":"Monitoring contract obligations"},{"text":"Supporting dispute resolution"},{"text":"Reviewing exclusivity clauses"},{"text":"Checking payment and commission terms"},{"text":"Supporting licensing and usage-rights negotiations"},{"text":"Coordinating with production houses, brands and legal counsel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Talent agencies"},{"text":"Artist-management companies"},{"text":"Film and television companies"},{"text":"Music labels"},{"text":"OTT platforms"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"Sports-management firms"},{"text":"Influencer-management agencies"},{"text":"Creator-management companies"},{"text":"Production houses"},{"text":"Medi